                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-8 mb-5 mb-lg-0 sidebar-enabled">
                     <div class="section-heading mb-5">
                        <h1 class="heading-section-color-bg fw-bold">Post Admission / Pre-Arrival / Arrival</h1>
                        <div class="intro-text">
                           		
                           	</div>
                     </div>
                     <p><span>Now that you have been admitted to California State University, Bakersfield, we want
                           to take this opportunity to congratulate and welcome you to both CSUB and the city
                           of Bakersfield.</span></p>
                     
                     <p><span> 
                           
                           <section class="section-accordion content-section bg-white position-relative my-5">
                              <div class="container p-0">
                                 <div class="row justify-content-md-center">
                                    <div class="col-12">
                                       <h2 class="heading-section-color-bg fw-bold">Your Next Steps</h2>
                                       <p>Before you book your airline ticket to Bakersfield, you will need to apply for a student
                                          visa. You will not be granted entry into the United States unless you have a student
                                          visa. Apply for a visa in the U.S. Embassy/Consulate in your country.</p>
                                       <div class="text-center mt-4 mb-3 expand-btn-container"><button id="toggle-all-d20e90" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" class="toggle-all btn btn-outline-secondary hvr-icon-forward small collapsed">Expand All</button></div>
                                       <div id="accordion-d20e90" class="accordion">
                                          <div class="card">
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-heading-1" class="card-header"><a role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" href="#accordion-d20e90-collapse-1" aria-controls="accordion-d20e90-collapse-1" class="card-link text-decoration-none link-text d-block">
                                                   <h3 class="link-text accordion-heading">1. APPLYING FOR A U.S. STUDENT VISA</h3></a></div>
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-collapse-1" aria-labelledby="accordion-d20e90-heading-1" class="parent collapsible collapse" style="">
                                                <div class="card-body">
                                                   <div class="section-text-box section-text-box-no-bg w-100 w-100">
                                                      <p>Many U.S. Embassies/Consulates now take approximately four to six weeks to process
                                                         student visas. Gather the following documents before proceeding with the visa appointment:</p>
                                                      
                                                      <ul>
                                                         
                                                         <li>I-20 from California State University, Bakersfield</li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Admission letter</li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Valid passport</li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Passport size photographs (specifications)</li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Financial documents</li>
                                                         </ul>
                                                   </div>
                                                </div>
                                             </div>
                                          </div>
                                          <div class="card">
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-heading-2" class="card-header"><a role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" href="#accordion-d20e90-collapse-2" aria-controls="accordion-d20e90-collapse-2" class="card-link text-decoration-none link-text d-block">
                                                   <h3 class="link-text accordion-heading">2. PAYING I-901 SEVIS FEES ONLINE:</h3></a></div>
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-collapse-2" aria-labelledby="accordion-d20e90-heading-2" class="parent collapsible collapse" style="">
                                                <div class="card-body">
                                                   <div class="section-text-box section-text-box-no-bg w-100 w-100">Information concerning the SEVIS I-901 fees can be found at the <a href="http://www.ice.gov/sevis/i901/index.htm">U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) website</a>.<br><br><strong>WHO MUST PAY THIS FEE:</strong><br>F-1 students and J-1 Exchange Visitors are required to pay a fee before applying for
                                                      a visa. <strong>The fee cannot be paid at the port of entry.</strong> The SEVIS fee is in addition to any other application fees.<br><br><strong>EXEMPTIONS AND SPECIAL CASES:</strong><br>F-2 and J-2 dependents are exempt from the SEVIS fee. J-1 visitors whose DS-2019s
                                                      are issued by the U.S. government are also exempt</div>
                                                </div>
                                             </div>
                                          </div>
                                          <div class="card">
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-heading-3" class="card-header"><a role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" href="#accordion-d20e90-collapse-3" aria-controls="accordion-d20e90-collapse-3" class="card-link text-decoration-none link-text d-block">
                                                   <h3 class="link-text accordion-heading">3. MANDATORY IMMIGRATION CHECK-IN SESSION</h3></a></div>
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-collapse-3" aria-labelledby="accordion-d20e90-heading-3" class="parent collapsible collapse" style="">
                                                <div class="card-body">
                                                   <div class="section-text-box section-text-box-no-bg w-100 w-100">
                                                      <p>New students must attend one of the check-in sessions as part of their orientation.
                                                         If you missed the check-in session, go directly to ISSP and tell them you need to
                                                         check in.</p>
                                                      
                                                      <p><strong>The following documents must be presented at the time of check-in:</strong></p>
                                                      
                                                      <ul>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Passport with visa and U.S. entry stamp, marked valid for duration of status by "D/S"</li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Copy of I-94 form, which can be retrieved from the&nbsp;<a href="https://i94.cbp.dhs.gov/I94/#/home">U.S. Customs and Border Protection website</a></li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>I-20 or DS-2019</li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Immunization records</li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Final official transcripts and certificates of completion, if they have not yet been
                                                            submitted</li>
                                                         </ul>
                                                   </div>
                                                </div>
                                             </div>
                                          </div>
                                          <div class="card">
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-heading-4" class="card-header"><a role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" href="#accordion-d20e90-collapse-4" aria-controls="accordion-d20e90-collapse-4" class="card-link text-decoration-none link-text d-block">
                                                   <h3 class="link-text accordion-heading">4. Orientation</h3></a></div>
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-collapse-4" aria-labelledby="accordion-d20e90-heading-4" class="parent collapsible collapse" style="">
                                                <div class="card-body">
                                                   <div class="section-text-box section-text-box-no-bg w-100 w-100">All newly-admitted students are required to attend international orientation, which
                                                      is scheduled the Friday before the 1st day of classes.</div>
                                                </div>
                                             </div>
                                          </div>
                                          <div class="card">
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-heading-5" class="card-header"><a role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" href="#accordion-d20e90-collapse-5" aria-controls="accordion-d20e90-collapse-5" class="card-link text-decoration-none link-text d-block">
                                                   <h3 class="link-text accordion-heading">5. REGISTER FOR CLASSES</h3></a></div>
                                             <div id="accordion-d20e90-collapse-5" aria-labelledby="accordion-d20e90-heading-5" class="parent collapsible collapse" style="">
                                                <div class="card-body">
                                                   <div class="section-text-box section-text-box-no-bg w-100 w-100">Communication on scheduling an advising appointment and registering for classes for
                                                      the Fall 2024 semester will come from the campus or the academic school of your major.<br><br>In order to become eligible for an academic advising appointment, you must:<br>
                                                      
                                                      <ul>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Be admitted to the university</li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Have submitted official transcripts and all required documents as an international
                                                            student</li>
                                                         
                                                         <li>Contact the Student Services Center for the department of your intended major for
                                                            more information</li>
                                                         </ul>
                                                   </div>
                                                </div>
                                             </div>
                                          </div>
                                       </div>
                                    </div>
                                 </div>
                              </div>
                           </section> 
                           </span></p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-12 col-lg-4 order-last order-lg-first">
                     <div class="container px-0 mb-5">
